supportive environments for learning and experimentation can help individuals, regardless of age, become more comfortable with technology.\n   - **User-Friendly Design:** Encouraging the development of intuitive, user-friendly technologies can make it easier for people of all ages to engage with new devices.\n   - **Encouraging Curiosity:** Fostering a mindset of curiosity and exploration can help both young and old discover intrinsic motivation to engage with technology.\n\nThis example serves as a reminder that while technology continues to evolve rapidly, human adaptability and engagement with technology are influenced by a complex interplay of factors beyond just age."}
