e, while the student can introduce new tools and perspectives.\n- **Focus on Lifelong Learning:** Emphasizing the importance of ongoing education and adaptability can help both generations thrive in a rapidly changing technological landscape.\n\nOverall, fostering an environment where both generations can learn from each other can mitigate the challenges posed by rapid technological change."}
