hting the importance of having positive role models and mentors can help guide the freshman in making better choices. The older person can share how they have been influenced by mentors in their own life.\n\n7. **Developing a Growth Mindset**:\n   - Encouraging a growth mindset can help the freshman view challenges as opportunities for learning and development rather than just obstacles.\n\n8. **Importance of Support Systems**:\n   - Discussing the value of having a support system, such as family, friends, or counselors, can help the freshman feel more confident in seeking help when facing difficult situations.\n\nBy focusing on these areas, the conversation can help the freshman develop a better understanding of the implications of risky behaviors and equip them with tools to make safer, more informed choices."}
