ame goals.\n\n**High Schooler:** Maybe you're right. I've never really thought about it that way.\n\n**Retiree:** It's never too late to try a new approach. It might take some practice, but finding peaceful ways to handle conflicts can lead to better relationships and a more positive environment for everyone involved.\n\n**High Schooler:** I'll definitely think about that. Thanks for the different perspective.\n\n---\n\nThis conversation highlights the differences in their experiences and attitudes towards risk-taking and conflict, while also encouraging the high schooler to consider alternative, non-confrontational approaches to handling disputes."}
